{# I7.1: managing disclosures. #}
- The information sheet explains the limits of confidentiality: if a participant discloses that they or someone else is at risk of serious harm, the research team may need to share this with the appropriate services.
- {{ s.safeguarding_names or "[Name the team member who handles disclosures]" }} decides on next steps for any disclosure, following UCL's safeguarding policy; where it is safe to do so, the participant is told before any information is shared.
- Disclosures and actions taken are recorded securely and separately from the research data.
